  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_tongue_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>tongue: a fresh (unsalted) animal tongue, of ox (linguis bovium) or pig (linguis porcorum); cf. the salted form (salted ox-tongue)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
